26:Tb3e,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How far is Dammam from Makkah by road?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"About 1,280 km via Riyadh, roughly 12 hours of driving before prayer, fuel and rest stops. Plan for a full day, or break the journey overnight if you are travelling with elderly relatives or young children."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much is a taxi from Dammam to Makkah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Estimated one-way fares start from SAR 1,550 (sedan, based on a Dhahran pickup) for the whole vehicle; the final fare is confirmed on WhatsApp before booking. The fare depends on the vehicle category, the date and your exact pickup and Makkah hotel. Send them on WhatsApp with your passenger and luggage count and we confirm one fixed fare before you book. There is no meter and no surge."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Should I drive, fly or take a private car from Dammam to Makkah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For one or two travellers with light luggage, flying from Dammam to Jeddah and taking a car for the last 80 km to Makkah saves the most time. A private car all the way suits families, groups, heavy luggage and anyone who wants to stop for prayer on their own schedule, door to door."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which Miqat will we pass on the way from Dammam to Makkah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Pilgrims travelling from the Riyadh and Najd direction enter Ihram at Qarn Al-Manazil, also called As-Sayl. If you are going for Umrah, tell us when you book and we plan the stop so you can change and make your intention before continuing. Our Miqat guide explains each location."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you collect from Al Khobar, Dhahran or Jubail instead of Dammam?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Dammam, Al Khobar and Dhahran are served as one area, and Jubail pickups can be arranged. Give us the pickup address and we confirm the fare for that point."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can we break the journey with an overnight stop?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Many families stop for the night partway, for example in Riyadh. Tell us your plan when you book so the quote and the timing reflect it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you also run the trip from Makkah back to Dammam?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We arrange Makkah to Dammam as well, one way or as part of a return trip. Send your Makkah hotel, travel date and passenger count on WhatsApp and we confirm the fare before booking."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I pay, and can I cancel?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can pay cash to the driver or by bank transfer, and an electronic receipt is available on request. Cancellation is free up to 24 hours before pickup."}}]}1b:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAF7] text-[#1C1C1C] pb-24","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TouristTrip\",\"name\":\"Dammam to Makkah Transfer\",\"description\":\"Private car with a driver from Dammam to Makkah — a long-distance transfer across the Kingdom via Riyadh, from Dammam, Al Khobar or Dhahran to your Makkah hotel, with prayer, rest and Miqat stops planned.\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/#taxiservice\"},\"itinerary\":{\"@type\":\"ItemList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Dammam\"}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Makkah\"}}]}}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$26"}}],"$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a",false,false,"$L2b"]}]
1f:{"metadata":[["$","title","0",{"children":"Dammam to Makkah Taxi | Private Car with Driver"}],["$","meta","1",{"name":"description","content":"Dammam to Makkah private car — about 1,280 km, around 12 hours, from Dammam, Khobar or Dhahran to your Makkah hotel. Fixed fare on WhatsApp; Miqat stop planned."}],["$","link","2",{"rel":"canonical","href":"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/routes/dammam-to-makkah"}],["$","meta","3",{"property":"og:title","content":"Taxi from Dammam to Makkah"}],["$","meta","4",{"property":"og:description","content":"Private car with a driver from Dammam to Makkah — a long-distance transfer across the Kingdom via Riyadh, from Dammam, Al Khobar or Dhahran to your Makkah hotel, with prayer, rest and Miqat stops planned."}],["$","meta","5",{"property":"og:url","content":"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/routes/dammam-to-makkah"}],["$","meta","6",{"property":"og:image","content":"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/opengraph-image"}],["$","meta","7",{"property":"og:image:width","content":"1200"}],["$","meta","8",{"property":"og:image:height","content":"630"}],["$","meta","9",{"property":"og:image:alt","content":"Taxi Saudi Arabia"}],["$","meta","10",{"property":"og:type","content":"website"}],["$","meta","11",{"name":"twitter:card","content":"summary_large_image"}],["$","meta","12",{"name":"twitter:title","content":"Dammam to Makkah Taxi | Private Car with Driver"}],["$","meta","13",{"name":"twitter:description","content":"Dammam to Makkah private car — about 1,280 km, around 12 hours, from Dammam, Khobar or Dhahran to your Makkah hotel. Fixed fare on WhatsApp; Miqat stop planned."}],["$","meta","14",{"name":"twitter:image","content":"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/opengraph-image"}],["$","meta","15",{"name":"twitter:image:width","content":"1200"}],["$","meta","16",{"name":"twitter:image:height","content":"630"}],["$","meta","17",{"name":"twitter:image:alt","content":"Taxi Saudi Arabia"}],["$","link","18",{"rel":"icon","href":"/icon.svg?5807c8323a0afe6d","type":"im